  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Accelerating Progress to End FGM and Child Marriage in Somali region (OWDA)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building on the achievements of the joint NCA and SC FGM and CEFM program from 2020 to 2024, this project will focus on the Somali region. It aims to significantly reduce new cases of Female Genital Mutilation (FGM) and child marriage among girls under 18 in all targeted intervention areas, fostering safer and more equitable communities for young girls.</narrative>
  </description>
